      "text": "for the Hamburg Declaration on Responsible Artificial Intelligence for the SGGs, the Sustainable Development Goals. This document is the first global declaration, specifically focused on AI and international development. And it outlines joint vision and shared principles and commitments to promote equitable, inclusive, and sustainable development and deployment of artificial intelligence around the world, but with a particular focus on empowering developing countries. The Declaration emphasizes human rights and a human-centered approach. And it underscores the importance of AI accessibility, which is a cornerstone of information accessibility in the AI age. It also commits to preserving and promoting information integrity. And the declaration has been endorsed by governments, by civil society, the private sector, international organizations and others to help promote AI that helps people and planet thrive.",
